        example:
          "A software engineer at a German company who develops a service invention squarely within her job duties must notify her employer in writing, and the employer's silence beyond the four-month window under § 6 ArbnErfG is treated as an implied claim, triggering the compensation duty regardless of whether the employer actually meant to claim it. A smartphone-standard SEP holder suing in Mannheim against a manufacturer that has made a serious, timely counteroffer and posted appropriate security is far less likely to obtain an injunction under the Huawei v. ZTE framework than one suing an implementer that ignored licensing negotiations altogether.",
